        <briefdescription>
<para>File path pattern for stdout redirection. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Supports timestamp placeholder TIMESTAMP% which expands to yyyyMMddHHmmss format at execution time.</para>
<para>Can be set in multiple ways: <preformatted>
// Direct string (supports TIMESTAMP% placeholder)
stdoutPath.set(&quot;build/logs/compiler-%TIMESTAMP%.log&quot;)

// Provider from layout (lazy, configuration cache compatible)
stdoutPath.set(layout.buildDirectory.file(&quot;logs/output.log&quot;).map { it.asFile.absolutePath })

// Convenience method with File
stdoutPath(project.file(&quot;my-output.log&quot;))

// Convenience method with Provider&lt;RegularFile&gt;
stdoutPath(layout.buildDirectory.file(&quot;logs/output.log&quot;))
</preformatted></para>
<para>If not set, stdout will be inherited from the parent process (normal fork) or redirected to a default timestamped log file (detached mode).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>the stdout file path pattern property </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
